Apply the rule: any folder that (a) contains its own public surface (index.ts or named exports consumed by siblings/ancestors) or (b) groups a coherent sub-domain (e.g. Billing, Onboarding/Profile, SignIn/ForgotPassword) earns its own module-context.md. Leaf-only folders (assets/, a single-file config/) are documented at the nearest meaningful parent. The entire src tree must be walked, not just the first two levels.